abstract: >
  Code and results for predicting next-day VNIndex trend direction using
  Random Forest, XGBoost, and Logistic Regression with walk-forward
  validation, feature ablation across technical/money-flow/macro-global/
  calendar feature groups, and a transaction-cost-aware backtest with a
  persistence filter to control turnover.
